{"3380410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cybreach", "steam_appid": 3380410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CYBREACH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The “Epsilon” space station was supposed to be your safe haven.<br>Instead, it became a death factory ruled by a deranged AI. It has turned the crew and passengers into an army of cyber-zombies — and it wants you to join them. The station’s corridors swarm with enemies, and every new wave hits harder than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the assault by upgrading your weapons and abilities.<br>Fight your way to the AI control center while your fate is still your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHOOT. BUILD. SURVIVE.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical Traps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different types of traps to slow down hordes, break their rush, or control key areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrading them lets you counter tougher enemies and hold the line as waves grow more intense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380410/extras/1ccef45f06e1c88cfe2f1ad755e5e79c.poster.avif?t=1781879785\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380410/extras/1ccef45f06e1c88cfe2f1ad755e5e79c.webm?t=1781879785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380410/extras/1ccef45f06e1c88cfe2f1ad755e5e79c.mp4?t=1781879785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Modular Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build weapons by combining barrels, magazines, sights, and other modules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create long-range rifles, gravity-pulse shotguns, or anything in between — every part shifts how your weapon handles and how effectively you can fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380410/extras/1bb0df75f92268e0240cbc5c4a3cf7af.poster.avif?t=1781879785\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380410/extras/1bb0df75f92268e0240cbc5c4a3cf7af.webm?t=1781879785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380410/extras/1bb0df75f92268e0240cbc5c4a3cf7af.mp4?t=1781879785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Suits &amp; Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each suit comes with its own set of unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new suits or upgrade the ones you have, and find the style that fits your role in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380410/extras/a2d8ce9d28ac8f83cd2cf15f4da15484.poster.avif?t=1781879785\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380410/extras/a2d8ce9d28ac8f83cd2cf15f4da15484.webm?t=1781879785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380410/extras/a2d8ce9d28ac8f83cd2cf15f4da15484.mp4?t=1781879785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-op (1–3 players): Abilities Combine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teamwork in CYBREACH runs on synergy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player lifts enemies into the air, another sets them on fire, while the third finishes the pack with a gravity strike or a well-placed trap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The better your combos — the better your chances of surviving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380410/extras/0756c2db48019ceeddc92287ad15e3d6.poster.avif?t=1781879785\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380410/extras/0756c2db48019ceeddc92287ad15e3d6.webm?t=1781879785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380410/extras/0756c2db48019ceeddc92287ad15e3d6.mp4?t=1781879785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>JOIN THE PLAYTEST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’re tuning enemy AI, wave balance, and the modular weapon system.<br>Every run helps shape the final game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Epsilon.<br>Don’t linger in the corridors — they breathe.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CYBREACH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The “Epsilon” space station was supposed to be your safe haven.<br>Instead, it became a death factory ruled by a deranged AI. It has turned the crew and passengers into an army of cyber-zombies — and it wants you to join them. The station’s corridors swarm with enemies, and every new wave hits harder than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the assault by upgrading your weapons and abilities.<br>Fight your way to the AI control center while your fate is still your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHOOT. BUILD. SURVIVE.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical Traps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different types of traps to slow down hordes, break their rush, or control key areas.